{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-dunelm-seasonal-doorstops-2606-0136","content_id":"18015e1f-854e-4a26-89bc-332d69a76a37","description":"Product Recall for Dunelm Seasonal Doorstops presenting a risk to health. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"cc8b40f2-ecdc-4592-96b9-d9e85a818892","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-06-11T10:51:16+01:00","id":"cc8b40f2-ecdc-4592-96b9-d9e85a818892","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-06-11T10:51:16+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a2a8514e50716856ed4aea3/2606-0136-product-recall-seasonal-dunelm-doorstops.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Dunelm Seasonal Doorstops</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The products present a risk to health as the sand inside the doorstops may be contaminated with a quantity of asbestos.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The products have been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by Dunelm.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Decorative articles/Homeware/Gardenware - Ornaments (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand </td>\n      <td>Dunelm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales period</td>\n      <td>November 2024 – February 2026</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Range of seasonal doorstops. Products from November 2024 onwards are affected. Please check the sewn in care label for the batch code in the format MMYYYY (eg 102025) and barcode number.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_cc8b40f2-ecdc-4592-96b9-d9e85a818892\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a2a8514e50716856ed4aea3/2606-0136-product-recall-seasonal-dunelm-doorstops.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"product-identifiers\">Product Identifiers</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product Name</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Barcode</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Article</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Rowan the Robin Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5063003909997</td>\n      <td>30971912</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Herringbone Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5063003868980</td>\n      <td>30960889</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Pumpkin Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5063003893463</td>\n      <td>30968790</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Huxley the Hedgehog Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5063003910115</td>\n      <td>30971884</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Checkerboard Doorstop</td>\n      <td>5063003869406</td>\n      <td>30961034</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The products present a risk to health as the sand inside the doorstops may be contaminated with a small quantity of asbestos. Asbestos is a banned substance because it poses a risk to health even at low levels of exposure.   </p>\n\n<p>The products do not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by  Dunelm.  We recommend owners stop using the products  immediately  and keep them out of the reach of children. Follow the below instructions for details on disposal and return of the products.  </p>\n\n<p>Consumers were alerted to a previous recall for Dunelm doorstops in May 2026, which can be viewed here: <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-dunelm-novelty-doorstops-2603-0019\">https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-dunelm-novelty-doorstops-2603-0019</a>.  </p>\n\n<p>For further information, please access <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.dunelm.com/info/help/product-safety-recalls\">the Dunelm website</a> or contact Dunelm via the Live Chat on the “contact us” page and 0333 234 0870.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"disposal-instructions\">Disposal instructions:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Stop using the product immediately. </li>\n  <li>If the product is undamaged, place in a heavy-duty plastic bag, double tape it securely, label it clearly and store in a secure location out of the reach of children. </li>\n  <li>If the product is damaged and sand is accessible, clean up sites where the product was used using wet cloths to avoid generating dust. Wear gloves and a mask. Double bag the sand, gloves, mask and cloths. </li>\n  <li>Keep children and other people away from areas where the sand has been used until the area has been cleaned. </li>\n  <li>Return the product to Dunelm, who will provide a full refund. If you are unable to return the product to Dunelm, follow the steps above and contact your local authority / access their website for guidance on safe disposal of asbestos in your area. </li>\n  <li>For further information, please contact Dunelm or visit the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/asbestos-in-consumer-products\">GOV.UK page on asbestos in consumer products</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2606-0136</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-11T09:57:48Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"product-identifiers","level":3,"text":"Product Identifiers"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"disposal-instructions","level":3,"text":"Disposal instructions:"},{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"household-decorative-articles","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","withdrawal-of-product-from-market"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-06-11","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-06-11T10:57:48+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-dunelm-seasonal-doorstops-2606-0136","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-dunelm-seasonal-doorstops-2606-0136","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-dunelm-seasonal-doorstops-2606-0136","content_id":"18015e1f-854e-4a26-89bc-332d69a76a37","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-06-11T09:57:48Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Dunelm Seasonal Doorstops (2606-0136)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-dunelm-seasonal-doorstops-2606-0136","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type",